# Allowlist: the VSIX ships only the compiled extension, the bundled MCP
# server, the webview assets and media. Everything else in the repo (source,
# tests, docs, test apps, editor config) stays out. vsce gives "!" patterns
# priority, so re-include exactly what ships rather than excluding afterwards.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!media/**
!mcp-server/index.js
!out/**/*.js
!out/webview/*.{html,css}
